  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nThe first time you click on an URL Input / Text field after you had your Main Menu opened with MM Placement being enabled will result in the keyboard spawning behind you / in weird places. It seems to be some how related to where / in what direction you opened your Main Menu last.\n**Steps to reproduce: (VR Only)**\n1. Turn on `MM Placement` in the Quick Menu\n2. Walk to an URL Input / Text field\n3. Turn away from it and open your Main Menu\n4. Now turn back at the Input field and click on it\nIf you do this you will notice that the keyboard will spawn behind your back / not where it should be. If you do the same again, but this time with `MM Placement` disabled, you will notice that now the keyboard will spawn correctly.\n# Attachments:\nHere is a video of my showcasing the issue: https://streamable.com/7icc8y (fixed the broken link)",
